# Pairs with NoRouteToClearedVictim. Clearing before route retirement can strand future writes.
MODULE: ClearWhileRouted
TARGET: NoRouteToClearedVictim
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the victim is cleared while a parent route may still select it
PERTURBS: ClearVictim

--- FIND
ClearVictim ==
    /\ ready
    /\ pending = "victim"
    /\ ~linked
    /\ ~routed
    /\ backLinkCorrect
    /\ victimExists
--- REPLACE
ClearVictim ==
    /\ ready
    /\ pending = "victim"
    /\ ~linked
    /\ backLinkCorrect
    /\ victimExists
--- END
